{"id":51507,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=51507"},"modified":"2026-10-28T15:29:38","modified_gmt":"2026-10-28T14:29:38","slug":"sintra-trail-cruz-alta","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sintra-trail-cruz-alta\/","title":{"rendered":"Sintra Trail \u2013 Cruz Alta 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Sintra Trail \u2013 Cruz Alta 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Sintra Trail \u2013 Cruz Alta 2026<\/strong> (3\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no domingo, <strong>1 de Novembro de 2026<\/strong>, com partidas a partir das <strong>08:15<\/strong> no <strong>Largo Rainha D. Am\u00e9lia<\/strong>, em frente ao emblem\u00e1tico <strong>Pal\u00e1cio Nacional de Sintra<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Sintra<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Lisboa<\/strong>. Esta prova diurna de montanha leva-te a subir do centro hist\u00f3rico da vila at\u00e9 ao ponto mais alto da <strong>Serra de Sintra<\/strong> \u2014 a m\u00edtica <strong>Cruz Alta<\/strong> (528 metros de altitude) \u2014 por estradas florestais de terra batida e trilhos de dificuldade t\u00e9cnica moderada.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Tens \u00e0 tua disposi\u00e7\u00e3o tr\u00eas desafios desenhados na Paisagem Cultural de Sintra (Patrim\u00f3nio Mundial da UNESCO): o competitivo <strong>Sintra Trail Cruz Alta 20 Km<\/strong> (<strong>750m D+<\/strong>, partida \u00e0s 08:15, pontu\u00e1vel para o <strong>Circuito Nacional de Trail da ATRP<\/strong>), com passagem pela Rampa do Castelo, <strong>Parque da Pena<\/strong>, <strong>Cruz Alta<\/strong>, <strong>Tapada do Mouco<\/strong> e <strong>Monserrate<\/strong>; o <strong>Trail Inicia\u00e7\u00e3o de 12 Km<\/strong> (<strong>550m D+<\/strong>, partida \u00e0s 08:45); e a <strong>Caminhada de 8 Km<\/strong> (<strong>450m D+<\/strong>, partida \u00e0s 09:00), que partilham a subida ao Parque da Pena, Cruz Alta e Tapada do Mouco antes do regresso ao Largo Rainha D. Am\u00e9lia.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Promovido pela <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Sintra<\/strong> com organiza\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00e9cnica da <strong>HMS Sports<\/strong>, o evento inclui t-shirt t\u00e9cnica, dorsal, medalha de finalista, servi\u00e7o de bengaleiro (07:15 \u00e0s 13:00), banhos na Escola B\u00e1sica D. Carlos I (Lourel) e abastecimentos eco-respons\u00e1veis sem copos descart\u00e1veis, sendo obrigat\u00f3rio levares recipiente pr\u00f3prio com capacidade m\u00ednima de 0,5L e telem\u00f3vel com carga. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">1 de Novembro de 2026<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Largo Rainha D. Am\u00e9lia, Sintra, Lisboa<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 